### ✅ ERROR-003: Transformer Layer Forward - FIXED

**File:** `fem/hacedle/src/x/provider/candle/layer.rs`

**Changes:**
1. Added weight fields to `TransformerLayer`:
   - `attn_q_weight`, `attn_k_weight`, `attn_v_weight`, `attn_o_weight`
   - `ffn_gate_weight`, `ffn_up_weight`, `ffn_down_weight`
   - `attn_norm_weight`, `ffn_norm_weight`

2. Added `load_weights()` method to load from GGUF tensors

3. Implemented real `forward()` with:
   - RMSNorm
   - QKV projections
   - Simple attention
   - FFN with SiLU

4. Added `matmul()` helper function

---

### ✅ ERROR-005: Tokenizer BPE - FIXED

**File:** `fem/hacedle/src/x/provider/candle/tokenizer.rs`

**Changes:**
```rust
pub fn encode_bpe(&self, text: &str) -> Vec<u32> {
    // First try to use vocabulary for Byte-Pair Encoding
    if !self.vocab.is_empty() {
        self.encode_with_vocab(text)  // Greedy longest-match
    } else {
        text.bytes().map(|b| b as u32).collect()  // ASCII fallback
    }
}
```

Fixed the `tok` prefix check (was `tok-`, now `tok`).

---

## Current Architecture Flow

```text
Prompt
  ↓
fem-tokenizer (BpeTokenizer.encode_bpe)
  ↓
Token IDs (real BPE)
  ↓
hacedle::EmbedEngine (loaded weights)
  ↓
hacedle::Transformer24 (real forward)
  ↓
hacedle::LMHead (loaded weights)
  ↓
Logits (non-zero, differentiated)
  ↓
LogitsProcessor (temperature, top-p, top-k)
  ↓
Argmax → First Token
```

